@startuml
title Figure 7 — UML Activity diagram — staged grounded analysis workflow
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #F7F7F7
  BorderColor #333333
}

|Customer Care Operator|
start
:Request analysis for selected customer;

|React operator UI|
:Submit protected analysis request with CSRF token;

|Spring Security / HTTP adapter|
if (Authenticated?) then (no)
  :Return HTTP 401;
  |React operator UI|
  :Display authentication required;
  |Customer Care Operator|
  stop
else (yes)
  :Resolve OperatorId through\nOperatorContextPort;
endif

|Analysis application|
:Load customer context through\nCustomerActivityPort;
:Invoke RiskSignalDetectorPort\nwith CustomerSnapshot;

|Detector adapter|
if (Detector succeeds?) then (no)
  :Return detector failure;
  |Analysis application|
  :Stop before grounding/model/history;
  |React operator UI|
  :Display analysis-stage failure;
  |Customer Care Operator|
  stop
else (yes)
  :Return RiskSignalEvidence[];\n(default no-op returns empty list)
endif

|Analysis application|
:Retrieve relevant knowledge through\nPolicyKnowledgePort;

|Policy adapter|
if (Relevant evidence available?) then (no)
  :Return explicit no-evidence result;
  |Analysis application|
  :Create insufficient-grounding outcome;
  |React operator UI|
  :Display insufficient grounding;
  |Customer Care Operator|
  stop
else (yes)
  :Return PolicyEvidence with provenance;
endif

|Analysis application|
:Assemble AnalysisEvidenceEnvelope;\nkeep source, detector and policy evidence distinct;
:Invoke AnalysisModelPort\nwith bounded evidence envelope;

|Model adapter|
if (Execution/provider succeeds?) then (no)
  :Return model failure;
  |Analysis application|
  :Create explicit analysis-failure outcome;
  |React operator UI|
  :Display analysis failure;
  |Customer Care Operator|
  stop
else (yes)
  :Return AnalysisModelOutput;\nstructured result + model provenance;
endif

|Analysis application|
:Validate AnalysisResult contract;
if (Valid structured result?) then (no)
  :Create explicit validation-failure outcome;
  |React operator UI|
  :Display invalid-analysis failure;
  |Customer Care Operator|
  stop
else (yes)
endif

|History adapter|
:Persist completed result plus\noperator, policy, detector and model provenance;
if (Persistence succeeds?) then (no)
  :Return persistence failure;
  |Analysis application|
  :Do not claim retained history;
  |React operator UI|
  :Display persistence failure;
  |Customer Care Operator|
  stop
else (yes)
  :Return generated AnalysisHistoryEntry;
endif

|Analysis application|
:Return completed grounded analysis;

|React operator UI|
:Render risk level, findings,\nrecommendations and layered provenance;

|Customer Care Operator|
:Review completed analysis;
stop
@enduml
